combined distribution uses GNU GPL version 3; see assets/licenses/GPL-3.0.txt.

Flutter branch changes, September-October 2026:
New Flutter presentation, reader, local library/cache, Android bridges and
listening implementation. Modified on 2026-10-15 to retire vendor-specific
speech integration, add configurable low-performance rendering, remove runtime
diagnostic entries and keep chapter-level listening progress/media metadata.
Modified on 2026-10-17 to refine paragraph/column page turns, preserve EPUB
image dimensions, add author work lists and retain complete login sessions.

The original Android app's embedded JNI API runtime (libcpp.so) was used by
0.3.x, with unchanged redistribution permission confirmed on 2026-10-15.
Starting with 0.4.0 the built-in provider is retired, its channel cannot make
content requests, and libcpp.so is excluded from APK packaging. Historical
binary files remain unmodified; no source or modification rights are implied.

Earlier releases included Source Han Serif CN Regular and Bold (Adobe, SIL
Open Font License 1.1). The font files are not distributed with 0.4.0; this
version uses platform fonts and optional user-imported fonts.

